    "description": "<p>When the Sidereal is the leader or a special character of a mass combat unit, he may activate this Charm reflexively. Once active, at the beginning of each action tick, the Sidereal and every other special character in the unit gains one mote to their respective Overdrive pools. Characters who do not already have an Overdrive pool gain a temporary five-mote pool that starts empty; this Charm does not increase the capacity of an existing Overdrive pool. An army can benefit from only one Battle Pattern Charm in a given battle.</p>",
